  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "Some Dips are Better Than Others",
  "body_html": "<p>If you want a relaxing ride… go with IWM. Late stage bull market, it is common that the smaller companies run significantly more, which will drive the Russell 2000. I have been bullish on the Russell for a long time, the point here, is I think it has significantly more runway. </p><p>I remain bearish on oil… please do not DM me about it trying to justify it. I likely will not respond or change my stance. I do think oil will be the biggest winner over the next decade, but there is no point in riding a significant drawdown first. </p><p>The S&amp;P 500 is approaching all time highs again…nice work to all those that held strong through that violent whiplash. I know they suck, but there was nothing screaming to me that the bull market was over. </p><p>Now, the stock I am adding to:  </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
